@q.face:Q{ck=~264:At native 32x32 and integer zoom, retain two distinct horizontally aligned cream eyes within the broad teal panel, with simple coherent flat regions and dark frame. Reject lost/merged facial landmarks or unmotivated speckling that replaces the reference hierarchy.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~40:Reference face and clean color hierarchy;so=[@s.brief,@s.reference,@s.observed,@s.reject-features];wh=@actor}
@q.mechanical:Q{ck=~189:The still candidate is 32x32 and every visible RGB color belongs to the palette extracted from reference.png. Report alpha and connectivity measurements separately; neither proves identity.;dm=mechanical;md=local;nm=~27:32x32 and reference palette;so=[@s.brief,@s.reference,@s.observed,@s.reject-features];wh=@actor}
@q.silhouette:Q{ck=~297:At native 32x32 and integer zoom, retain the reference tall rectangular body/frame, two upright separated prongs, deep open upper gap and their relative proportions. Inspect flat alpha masks and colored views on diagnostic backgrounds. Reject a different body silhouette or collapsed identity gap.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~36:Reference silhouette and proportions;so=[@s.brief,@s.reference,@s.observed,@s.reject-features];wh=@actor}
